<title>UK: Prudential's tele-bank opens on Oct 1.</title>
<headline>Prudential's tele-bank opens on Oct 1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurer Prudential Corp on Wednesday said its earlier announced new tele-banking operation will start on October 1.</p>
<p>The company will be offering deposit accounts and mortgages, which can be set up and accessed through mail and telephone.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
